Package: mlmr
Title: A Guided Interface for Mixed-Effects and Multilevel Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Marcus", "Harris", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "marcus.harris.uconn@gmail.com")
Description: Provides a guided Shiny interface and reusable R helpers for
    specifying, fitting, explaining, and reporting mixed-effects and multilevel
    models with 'lme4' (Bates, Maechler, Bolker, and Walker, 2015,
    <doi:10.18637/jss.v067.i01>). The package supports grand-mean and
    cluster-mean centering (Enders and Tofighi, 2007,
    <doi:10.1037/1082-989X.12.2.121>), nested and crossed random-effects
    structures, interaction terms, level-by-level and combined equations,
    APA-style tables, diagnostics, reproducible code, and software citation
    support for manuscript workflows.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
